  "question_stem": "Megan sends messages to her friends in one of 3 different ways: text, email or social media. For each message, the probability that she uses text is $0.3$ and the probability that she uses email is $0.2$. She receives an immediate reply from a text message with probability $0.4$, from an email with probability $0.15$ and from social media with probability $0.6$.",
  "context_texts": [
    "The send branches are text $0.3$, email $0.2$, social media $0.5$; the corresponding no-reply probabilities are $0.6$, $0.85$ and $0.4$."
